    "Strength uses a handling check for press, row, and suitcase squat at your chosen load. Choose standard 8–12 reps or confirm safe handling for 4–6 reps. RDL uses 6–10 reps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strength uses a handling check for press, row, and suitcase squat at your chosen load. Choose standard 8–12 reps or confirm safe handling for 4–6 reps. RDL uses 6–10 reps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original routine concentrates lower-body and direct trunk work once a week. It does not provide twice-weekly coverage of every muscle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
